
@startuml

actor User
participant "Web Page" as Page
participant "Content Script (content.js)" as CS
participant "Injected Script (navigation-events.js)" as IS
participant "Background Service Worker (background.js)" as BSW
participant "Popup UI (popup.js)" as PU
participant "Data Control UI (data-control.js)" as DCU
participant "Image Save Page (save.js)" as ISP
cloud "External APIs & Analytics" as Remote

User -> Page: Visits webpage
Page -> CS: Injects (content.js)
CS <-> BSW: Chrome Runtime Messaging (init, mixpanel, isSupportedWebsite, errors, etc.)

Page -> IS: Injects (navigation-events.js via web_accessible_resources)
IS -> Page: window.postMessage (navigation events: pushState, replaceState, popstate)

User -> PU: Clicks extension icon (opens popup.html)
PU <-> BSW: Chrome Runtime Messaging (implicit interaction to set popup)

User -> DCU: Accesses Data Control Page (data-control.html)
DCU -> BSW: Chrome Runtime Messaging (GetMachineKey, GetAbTestsConfig for activation)
DCU -> BSW: browser.management.uninstallSelf (uninstall)
DCU -> Page: Redirects on activation

User -> ISP: Interacts with image save functionality (save.html)
ISP -> Page: window.parent.postMessage (imgUrl, imgData for processed image)

BSW -> Remote: Fetch (IS_SUPPORTED_WEBSITE_API, SUPPORTED_WEBSITES_API, MIXPANEL_URL, EXTENSION_AB_TESTS_API, EXTENSION_CONFIG_API)
BSW <-> Remote: Mixpanel tracking (extension_installed_background, mixpanelUserProfile)

Page <-> Remote: Direct fetch/API calls (via Content Security Policy connect-src)

database "Extension Local Storage" as LocalStorage
database "Extension Sync Storage" as SyncStorage

BSW <-> LocalStorage: chrome.storage.local (get, set, remove, clear for cached data, AB test records, user settings, auth)
BSW <-> SyncStorage: chrome.storage.sync (get, set, remove for authKey, authValue, machineKey if localStorage is undefined)

DCU <-> LocalStorage: localStorage (setItem for ACTIVATED)
BSW <-> LocalStorage: localStorage (getItem for ACTIVATED, MACHINE_KEY)

@enduml
